# 🍽️ Canteen Management System

A simple and responsive web-based Canteen Management System developed using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Python.  
This project helps users browse food items, explore menus, and navigate different sections of the canteen website easily.

---

## 📌 Features

- 🏠 Home Page
- 📋 Interactive Menu Section
- 🍜 Food Item Display
- 🔐 Login Functionality
- 📱 Responsive Design
- 🎨 Attractive UI using CSS
- ⚡ Dynamic Interactions with JavaScript

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Python

---

